<title>BRAZIL: Brazil to announce federal tax receipts.</title>
<headline>Brazil to announce federal tax receipts.</headline>
<dateline>BRASILIA 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil's Federal Tax Secretariat was due to announce federal tax receipts for the month of September at 1600 local/1800 GMT, a finance ministry spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>Receipts in August were 7.436 billion reais, down 5.28 percent in real terms from July.</p>
<p>-- William Schomberg, Brasilia newsroom 5561 2230358</p>
</text>
